{
  "_readme": [
    "Hand-curated, keyed by the exact st_nm value in the source data. Kept separate",
    "from the generated data/states.js so that regenerating the map never destroys",
    "human judgement.",
    "",
    "  id      short code, ISO 3166-2:IN suffix where one exists",
    "  emoji   the matching cue. MUST be unique across all 36 -- a four-year-old",
    "          matches piece to slot on this picture, not on the name, so two",
    "          states sharing an emoji makes the puzzle ambiguous. project.mjs",
    "          asserts uniqueness and fails the build.",
    "  level   the first level this state appears at; level N shows level <= N",
    "  say     what the speech synthesiser should pronounce. Only set where the",
    "          spelling misleads an en-IN voice; otherwise the name is used.",
    "  sticker the reward-book caption, written for a small child"
  ],

